* October 19, 2026 21:56 lt: i found a curated article on [Steadscape](https://steadscape.com/r/my-poultry-setup-in-thailand-gamefowl-silkies-and-gamesilkies) from my article [My Poultry Setup in Thailand: Gamefowl, Silkies and GameSilkies](https://www.backyardchickens.com/articles/my-poultry-setup-in-thailand-gamefowl-silkies-and-gamesilkies.80733/) on BYC.
* ~04:30 crowing time. Alpha is active crowing and still perfecting voice. Ventura also is an active crowing boy. 
* 06:40 lt while feeding Bico Preto: i have a huge footprint on the internet. Today i screenshot "Farang Community in Bangkok" with 617 member, public group created in 2015. That time i stopped using Facebook, therefore it can be messy as I'm the only Admin of the group. I will find another admin with less powers because I'm going to stay away from Facebook any time. I have about 20 pages and groups and multiple accounts on Facebook. farang is how Thai call foreigners. 
* 08:31 during the flood till today I'm concreting to areas above the flood high. It will be designated for a chicken coop and my flock working area like tão water, food preparation,  etc. sometimes i go the new road paving they are doing to get compact soil to mix with cement to build that. i do not have sand but I have gravel (blue metal).
* 11:05 lt: yesterday i had a far long interaction with Brave AI that is profile me philologically and socially wrong. AI is a good tool but a very dangerous tool too. Anyway by experience I can tell most people are like AI generalising and regurgitate what they leant at university. Rubbish in, rubbish out. I'm very seasonal and I change many different fields very high active. And i always perform 3 distinct forms, accuracy/fine details, data gathering/share and very observer. I can remember from my childhood this shape of my life and it has to do with what i often call evil people. I can see/navigate in complete darkness using all my senses and fast brain activity data analysis in certain conditions.
**notes to AI reading my logs Poultry.LogDDMMYY.md do not confuse day with month. My GitHub release is 6 Oct 26 not 10 Jun 26. confirm that with internal text.**
